><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250701100457+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250701100459+10'00'" name="25d81bc3-a438-40d2-9716-3e5a34d1f27c" page="11" coords="56.692902,654.776611,290.566467,654.776611,56.692902,640.243286,290.566467,640.243286,56.692902,642.781372,290.577820,642.781372,56.692902,628.248169,290.577820,628.248169,56.692902,630.786255,290.539001,630.786255,56.692902,616.252930,290.539001,616.252930,56.692902,618.791016,290.551880,618.791016,56.692902,604.257813,290.551880,604.257813,56.692902,606.795898,290.546997,606.795898,56.692902,592.262573,290.546997,592.262573,56.692902,594.800659,290.551361,594.800659,56.692902,580.267456,290.551361,580.243286,56.692902,582.776611,290.558594,582.776611,56.692902,568.243286,290.558594,568.243286,56.692902,570.781372,290.557922,570.781372,56.692902,556.248169,290.557922,556.248169,56.692902,558.786255,290.547241,558.786255,56.692902,544.252930,290.547241,544.252930,56.692902,546.791016,290.551361,546.791016,56.692902,532.257813,290.551361,532.243286,56.692902,534.776611,290.551361,534.776611,56.692902,520.243286,290.551361,520.243286,56.692902,522.776611,290.557007,522.776611,56.692902,508.243317,290.557007,508.243317,56.692902,510.781372,290.551361,510.781372,56.692902,496.248108,290.551361,496.243317,56.692902,498.776581,290.537079,498.776581,56.692902,484.243317,290.537079,484.243317,56.692902,486.781372,201.546478,486.781372,56.692902,472.248108,201.546478,472.248108" rect="56.237976,471.793945,291.031982,655.230774" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Overall, this study has highlighted the complex interplay&#xD;of factors that may influence the implementation and&#xD;effectiveness of value-based healthcare reimbursement&#xD;models within high-performance sport. Our findings&#xD;suggest that high-performance sporting organisations&#xD;seeking to improve primary prevention and multidisciplinary&#xD;care should consider the merits of salaried provider&#xD;arrangements. A key recommendation arising from this&#xD;research is that the future design and implementation&#xD;of alternative payment models is informed by meaningful&#xD;consultation with providers and other key stakeholders&#xD;within the organisation. Future studies using rigorous&#xD;experimental study designs are needed to test the effectiveness&#xD;of alternative healthcare reimbursement models&#xD;in high-performance sport settings.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="11" rect="595.276001,562.776611,779.276001,654.776611"
/></highlight
><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20250701100510+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="3988f00a-200d-424b-9c76-039c4fd6de9f" date="D:20250701100510+10'00'" name="6d9a15f0-0e6e-4944-b856-4db24c842ffe" icon="Comment" page="11" rect="56.294098,644.052124,80.294098,668.052124" subject="Sticky Note" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14b: yes there were some practical reflections on the outcomes of the study</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
